    "# Stage 3: Nested Hyperparameter Optimization, Deep Learning & Metallurgical Residual Audit\n",
    "**B.Tech Project in Metallurgical and Materials Engineering, IIT Roorkee**\n",
    "**Project:** Machine-Learning Prediction of Mechanical Properties of Steels from Composition, with Inverse Alloy Design\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "### Key Highlights:\n",
    "1. **Nested Cross-Validation:** Hyperparameter tuning with Optuna is performed inside outer cross-validation folds to prevent tuning leakage.\n",
    "2. **Algorithm Diversity:** Comparing Tuned Random Forest, Tuned XGBoost, a custom PyTorch 2-layer MLP, and a non-parametric Gaussian Process Regressor with Matern kernel.\n",
    "3. **Statistical Model Selection:** Paired difference comparisons with bootstrap 95% confidence intervals across identical splits.\n",
    "4. **Metallurgical Residual Audit:** Error inspection across 9 alloying elements, outlier audit of top-10 worst predicted alloys, and family breakdown (Maraging, Stainless, Tool, and Structural steels).\n",
    "5. **Sanity Checks:** Permutation test (target scrambling) and single largest cluster removal test."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": None,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
